Client statistics

Connection statistics

If you are using the mysqli ' . 
                                               'extension, these statistics can be obtained ' . 
                                               'through two API calls:

mysqli_get_client_stats()

mysqli_get_connection_stats()


Statistics are aggregated among ' . 
                                               'all extensions that use MySQL Native Driver. ' . 
                                               'For example, when compiling both ext/mysql and ' . 
                                               'ext/mysqli against MySQL Native Driver, both function ' . 
