                                               'certain statistic. You can configure the PDO MySQL ' . 
                                               'Driver, ext/mysql and ext/mysqli to optionally use ' . 
                                               'the MySQL Native Driver. When doing so, all three ' . 
                                               'extensions will change the statistics. 

Accessing Client Statistics

To access client statistics, you need ' . 
                                               'to call mysqli_get_client_stats(). The function ' . 
                                               'call does not require any parameters. 

The function returns an associative ' . 
                                               'array that contains the name of the statistic as the ' . 
                                               'key and the statistical data as the value. 

Client statistics can also be ' . 
                                               'accessed by calling the phpinfo() function. 

Accessing Connection Statistics

